all situated in the Ratnapura District of Sri Lanka. It has a shape very similar to the leaf of the Sacred fig or \"Bo\" (\u0db6\u0ddd) tree, which has earned it this name. The waterfall is a major tourist attraction in the country. Local myths say that it is haunted and that it hides a treasure trove.</p>"}